Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:08.626 --> 00:23:14.087
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:14.231 --> 00:23:19.168
Donna ni tooku

00:23:19.303 --> 00:23:24.263
Hanarete ite mo

